    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is FluidFrames?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing FluidFrames, the AI-powered app designed to transform your videos like never before.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With FluidFrames, you can<strong> double (x2), quadruple (x4), octuple (x8) the FPS in your videos</strong>, creating ultra-smooth and high-definition playback.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to slow things down? FluidFrames also allows you to convert any video into stunning slow-motion, bringing every detail to life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for content creators, videographers, and anyone looking to enhance their visual media, FluidFrames provides an intuitive and powerful toolset to elevate your video projects. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other AI apps.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QualityScaler </strong>- image/video AI upscaler app</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Elegant and easy to use GUI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Resize video before frame generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple GPUs support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with all GPUs <strong>(AMD, Intel, Nvidia)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compatible video - mp4, wemb, mkv, flv, gif, avi, mov, mpg, qt, 3gp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Video frame-generation STOP&amp;RESUME</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PRIVACY FOCUSED - no internet connection required / everything is on your PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Video frames generation<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x2 =&gt; <strong>60fps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x4 =&gt; <strong>120fps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x8 =&gt; <strong>240fps</strong></p></li></ul></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Video slowmotion<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x2 slowmotion =&gt; <strong>30fps - 2 times slower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x4 slowmotion =&gt; <strong>30fps - 4 times slower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x8 slowmotion =&gt; <strong>30fps - 8 times slower</strong></p></li></ul></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is FluidFrames?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing FluidFrames, the AI-powered app designed to transform your videos like never before.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With FluidFrames, you can<strong> double (x2), quadruple (x4), octuple (x8) the FPS in your videos</strong>, creating ultra-smooth and high-definition playback.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to slow things down? FluidFrames also allows you to convert any video into stunning slow-motion, bringing every detail to life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for content creators, videographers, and anyone looking to enhance their visual media, FluidFrames provides an intuitive and powerful toolset to elevate your video projects. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other AI apps.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QualityScaler </strong>- image/video AI upscaler app</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Elegant and easy to use GUI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Resize video before frame generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple GPUs support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with all GPUs <strong>(AMD, Intel, Nvidia)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compatible video - mp4, wemb, mkv, flv, gif, avi, mov, mpg, qt, 3gp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Video frame-generation STOP&amp;RESUME</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PRIVACY FOCUSED - no internet connection required / everything is on your PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Video frames generation<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x2 =&gt; <strong>60fps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x4 =&gt; <strong>120fps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x8 =&gt; <strong>240fps</strong></p></li></ul></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Video slowmotion<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x2 slowmotion =&gt; <strong>30fps - 2 times slower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x4 slowmotion =&gt; <strong>30fps - 4 times slower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30fps =&gt; x8 slowmotion =&gt; <strong>30fps - 8 times slower</strong></p></li></ul></p></li></ul>",
